# Kestral sync routing

When saving **new content** to a project from chat:

| Intent | MCP tool |
| ------ | -------- |
| Inline text (Slack paste, summary, notes) | `create_document` + `projectId` |
| File on disk | `upload_document` |
| External URL | `link_external_document` |
| Task/project mutations | `project_management` — not for new doc bodies |
| Short project summary only | `update_project` description (brief, not a dump) |

Never use `project_management` or project description updates as a substitute for creating a document.
